      "content": "hey, i'm working on the launch strategy for a new ultra-premium fragrance line. we're trying to figure out exactly who our core high-net-worth audience is so we can optimize our ad spend. can you help me build out 3 or 4 detailed consumer personas? i need to know their lifestyle, interests, and also their typical demographic makeup/ethnicity so we can target the right cultural segments. thanks",
